guide forever/reputation/undercity
title Undercity Reputation
category Reputation
folder Reputation · Cities
faction Horde
levels 12-60
zone Undercity
keywords Undercity, Ralston Farnsley, cloth quartermaster, cloth donation, Runecloth, Additional Runecloth, Wool, Silk, Mageweave, Nathanos Blightcaller, The Bulwark, Scourge Cauldrons, The Spider God, Shadra, Venom to the Undercity, Deathknell, Brill, skeletal horse, Zachariah Post
reward text Exalted with the Undercity
reward item 18791
why The Plaguelands' level 55-60 quests and Runecloth to Exalted, with Tirisfal's old quests as an optional extra.

# Built from Forever's quest data: every quest that pays Undercity reputation,
# with the value from Forever's own quest pages, the world database (quest
# chains, the cloth quests' exclusive group, Additional
# Runecloth's repeat flag), quests.json, npcs.json, items.json and the quest
# notes for givers, objectives, drops and places, and the Forever client's
# Faction and ItemSparse tables.
# Numbers (Forever's quest pages): A Donation of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and
# Runecloth 150 each (60 cloth); Additional Runecloth 50 for 20 Runecloth (the
# same as Classic Era).
# Starting standing (Faction table): Undead Friendly 1000; Orc, Tauren, Troll
# and Skyborne Neutral 500. No race has a reputation bonus. The Legacy perk
# Diplomat adds 2% a rank, 10% at 5/5: the numbers here leave it out. City
# reputation also gives a quarter to the other Horde cities (Faction table:
# parent Horde, 0.25), except starting-zone quests.
# Low-level quests: in Classic a quest 6 or more levels below you pays less, a
# fifth at 60; quests of level 55 and up pay in full at 60, so Nathanos and the
# Bulwark come first (the Bulwark's first quests are level 53: a little less).
# The old hubs are optional steps (the first step of each carries a label;
# skipping it skips the hub), ranked by reputation per minute at full value
# with the fifth beside it.
# INGAME: grey-quest reputation at 60 (Classic: a fifth from 9 levels below; one Forever beta report: full, quest 456 at level 30 paid 100)
# INGAME: reputation discounts in Forever (Classic: 10% at Honored with the city's merchants; Forever guide sites report 5/10/15/20% from Friendly to Exalted, one says not announced)
# Left out: class letters and Undead-only quests (Rude Awakening gates The
# Mindless Ones in Deathknell), race-only breadcrumbs, Chemist Fuely's ooze
# chain (Felwood and Un'Goro, about 290 at 60, named in a tip), dungeon and
# raid quests (The Key to Scholomance 200, The Darkstone Tablet 150, Nathanos's
# Stratholme quests, Rend and Nefarian, named in tips), the seasonal Stinking
# Up Southshore, Commendation Signets (only from the Ahn'Qiraj war effort).
# Mounts: the client lets every Horde race ride every Horde mount and puts no
# reputation gate on them.
# ASSUMED: another race's skeletal horses need Exalted with the Undercity (Classic rule; Forever's client puts no reputation gate on the items, so the vendor decides). In-game check: a non-Undead below Exalted at Zachariah Post.

step Undercity: how it works
  tip Undercity reputation comes from quests and cloth. Ralston Farnsley, the cloth quartermaster, stands in the Magic Quarter beside the tailors. He takes four one-time donations of 60 cloth (150 each) and then Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth for 50, as often as you like. Every point you earn with the Undercity also gives a quarter as much to Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff and the Darkspear Trolls. While you level, do the Undercity's quests within 5 levels of them: Tirisfal at 1 to 12, Silverpine at 10 to 20, Hillsbrad and Tarren Mill at 20 to 33. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10%. Rewards: at Honored the Undercity's merchants sell to you for 10% less (the Classic rule), the horse vendor included; at Exalted other races can buy the skeletal horses: 20 gold for a level 40 horse, 200 gold for a level 60 warhorse, once you have mount training. The Undercity has no tabard or other reward.
  accept 7813                         -- Ralston Farnsley: A Donation of Wool, +150

step Undercity: Harbinger Balthazad
  zone Undercity
  tip The level 55 to 60 quests pay in full. First the Bulwark: Harbinger Balthazad, by the Undercity's elevators, sends you there.
  level 55
  accept 5094                         -- A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!, +10

step The Bulwark: Scarlet Diversions
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip The Bulwark is the Forsaken camp on the road from Tirisfal into the Western Plaguelands. High Executor Derrington's chain sends you against the Scourge cauldrons of the Western Plaguelands: about 820 Undercity reputation, about 710 at 60 if the level 53 quests pay less. Take a Flame in a Bottle from the box beside him; burn the command tent of the Scarlet camp between Dalson's Tears and Felstone Field and plant the Scourge Banner beside it.
  turnin 5094                         -- High Executor Derrington
  accept 5096                         -- Scarlet Diversions, +100 (level 53)
  complete 5096 map 1422 @40.7,51.9   -- the Scarlet Crusade Forward Camp

step The Bulwark: the cauldrons
  turnin 5096
  accept 5228                         -- The Scourge Cauldrons, +10
  accept 5098                         -- All Along the Watchtowers, +100
  turnin 5228                         -- Shadow Priestess Vandis
  accept 5229                         -- Target: Felstone Field, +100 (level 53)

