  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Cauldron Lord Bilemaw guards the cauldron at Felstone Field. Click the cauldron after the kill to start Return to the Bulwark. Mark the four towers of Andorhal with the Beacon Torch at their doors.
  collect 13194 quest 5229.1          -- Felstone Field Cauldron Key
  turnin 5229                         -- the Scourge Cauldron
  accept 5230                         -- Return to the Bulwark, +50
  kill 10902 quest 5098.1 @40.05,71.6 -- Andorhal Tower One: use the Beacon Torch at the door
  kill 10903 quest 5098.2 @42.33,66.24 -- Andorhal Tower Two
  kill 10904 quest 5098.3 @44.3,63.25 -- Andorhal Tower Three
  kill 10905 quest 5098.4 @46.62,71.05 -- Andorhal Tower Four

