step The Bulwark: done
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip The Bulwark is also where The Key to Scholomance ends (200), after a longer chain. Chemist Fuely in the Undercity's Apothecarium pays about 290 more for oozes from Felwood and Un'Goro Crater.
  turnin 5236                         -- Shadow Priestess Vandis

step Nathanos Blightcaller
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Nathanos Blightcaller, the Ranger Lord, keeps his camp on the western edge of the Eastern Plaguelands. His quests are level 58 to 60 and pay in full: 500 Undercity reputation.
  level 56
  accept 6042                         -- Un-Life's Little Annoyances, +100
  accept 6022                         -- To Kill With Purpose, +100
  accept 6133                         -- The Ranger Lord's Behest, +100

step Plaguebats, Quel'Lithien Lodge and Corin's Crossing
  tip The Noxious Plaguebats fly in the south of the zone, the Monstrous Plaguebats further north-west. Quel'Lithien Lodge is north-west of Light's Hope Chapel; the Quel'Thalas Registry lies inside. Do Corin's Crossing last: its Scourge drop Living Rot, which lasts only 10 minutes. With 7 in your bags, use the Mortar and Pestle at once for the Coagulated Rot.
  kill 8601 x20 quest 6042.1          -- Noxious Plaguebat
  kill 8602 x10 quest 6042.2          -- Monstrous Plaguebat
  kill 8564 x8 quest 6133.2           -- Ranger
  kill 8565 x8 quest 6133.1           -- Pathstrider
  kill 8563 x8 quest 6133.3           -- Woodsman
  collect 15847 quest 6133.4          -- Quel'Thalas Registry
  collect 15448 quest 6022.1 @52.6,58.6 -- Coagulated Rot: 7 Living Rot and the Mortar and Pestle

