step Duskwing and Borelgore
  tip Duskwing, an elite bat, roams the fields north of Marris Stead. Borelgore paces a long valley west of Northdale.
  collect 15850 quest 6135.1          -- Patch of Duskwing's Fur
  kill 11896 quest 6136.1             -- Borelgore
  turnin 6135                         -- Nathanos Blightcaller
  turnin 6136
  note "Nathanos: 500 Undercity reputation. His Stratholme quests (The Crimson Courier, The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria, Ramstein) need a group."

step The Spider God (optional chain)
  label shadra
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Six quests across the Hinterlands, Tarren Mill, Sen'jin Village, Zul'Farrak and the Undercity: 600 Undercity and 225 Darkspear reputation. Summoning Shadra and Venom to the Undercity are level 55 and pay 400 in full at 60; the four before them are level 43 to 45 (a fifth at 60 in Classic, 440 Undercity in all then). Allow about 90 minutes with the travel. The Venom Bottles stand on the tables of the Witherbark village in the west of the Hinterlands: click one to start.
  accept 2933 object 142702           -- Venom Bottle: Venom Bottles, +100

