step Zul'Farrak: the Tablet of Theka
  when done shadra
  zone Tanaris
  tip Zul'Farrak is a level 44 to 54 dungeon in northern Tanaris; a level 60 can clear the way alone, or bring a group. Theka the Martyr, an elite troll, guards his tomb in the instance: kill him and read the Tablet of Theka there.
  goto 38.7,20.0 "Zul'Farrak"
  complete 2936                       -- read the Tablet of Theka

