step Deathknell (optional hub)
  label deathknell
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Deathknell, the Forsaken start at the west end of Tirisfal: about 900 Undercity reputation in 25 minutes (180 at a fifth). Starting-zone quests give the other cities no share. Novice Elreth, Executor Arren and Deathguard Saltain stand in the village.
  accept 376                          -- Novice Elreth: The Damned, +100
  collect 3265 x6 quest 376.1         -- Scavenger Paw
  collect 3264 x6 quest 376.2         -- Duskbat Wing
  turnin 376

