  when done deathknell
  tip The Equipment Boxes are all around the village. Night Web's Hollow is the mine north-west; the Webbed Forsaken hang inside. Samuel Fipps waits at the ruined camp by the road north-east: bury his remains at Marla's Grave, in the front row of the village graveyard.
