step Brill (optional hub)
  label brill
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Brill and the fields around it: about 1,100 Undercity reputation in 45 minutes (220 at a fifth). Executor Zygand, Magistrate Sevren, Apothecary Johaan, Deathguard Dillinger and Coleman Farthing are in the town.
