step Ralston Farnsley: A Donation of Wool
  zone Undercity
  tip From here it is cloth. Wool, Silk and Mageweave must all be handed in before Ralston offers the Runecloth donation, and Additional Runecloth needs the Runecloth donation. Buy cloth at the Auction House, or farm it: humanoids drop it, Wool from level 15 to 25, Silk 25 to 40, Mageweave 40 to 50, Runecloth 50 and up. At 60 farm mobs of level 52 or more: lower ones are grey.
  zone Ashenvale
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7813.1 @36,37      -- Wool Cloth: the Thistlefur furbolgs drop it about one kill in four
  turnin 7813                         -- Ralston Farnsley, +150

step A Donation of Silk
  tip Silk: the Syndicate in Hillsbrad and Alterac drop it about one kill in three, or buy it.
  level 26
  accept 7814                         -- +150
  zone Alterac Mountains
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7814.1 @57.7,67.6 -- Silk Cloth: the Syndicate
  turnin 7814

step A Donation of Mageweave
  tip Mageweave: the Jadefire satyrs in southern Felwood and the Dunemaul ogres in Tanaris drop it about one kill in three, or buy it.
  level 40
  accept 7817                         -- +150
  zone Felwood
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7817.1 @41.6,85.7 -- Mageweave Cloth: the Jadefire satyrs
  turnin 7817

step A Donation of Runecloth
  tip Runecloth: the Scarlet at Tyr's Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands, the Gordok ogres outside Dire Maul in Feralas and the Twilight camps of Silithus drop it about one kill in three. The Auction House is faster if you have gold.
  level 50
  accept 7818                         -- +150
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7818.1 live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth: the Scarlet outside Tyr's Hand
  turnin 7818

step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Additional Runecloth: 20 Runecloth for 50 reputation, as often as you like. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 120 hand-ins, 2,400 Runecloth, less what the quests gave you (an Undead starts at Friendly 1,000: 100 hand-ins; every other race starts at Neutral 500 and first needs 50 hand-ins, 1,000 Runecloth, to reach Friendly). Hand in every 20 you carry, one after another.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth: the Scarlet outside Tyr's Hand
  turnin 7819 direct optional         -- Ralston Farnsley: Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 68 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Honored to Revered is 12,000: 240 hand-ins, 4,800 Runecloth. The Darkstone Tablet (Blackrock Depths) pays 150 in full.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7819 direct optional         -- Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 68 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 420 hand-ins, 8,400 Runecloth. For The Horde! (Rend's head) and The Lord of Blackrock (Nefarian's head) pay 200 to every Horde city. At Exalted, Zachariah Post in Brill sells the skeletal horses to every Horde race: 20 gold for a level 40 horse, 200 gold for a level 60 warhorse (Forever's prices); in Classic other races needed Exalted to buy them.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7819 direct optional         -- Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 68 Exalted
  talk 4731 optional                  -- Zachariah Post: the skeletal horses
